      core-detection/src/test/kotlin/io/github/valossa515/tapguard/core/detection/signal/InstallSourceCollectorCopiedSetsTest.kt,create,AC-005; mutacao de cada conjunto de entrada
      core-detection/src/test/kotlin/io/github/valossa515/tapguard/core/detection/signal/InstallSourceCollectorTest.kt,modify,AC-004 e AC-015 e AC-016; atualizar quatro chamadas sem remover expectativas
      core-detection/src/test/kotlin/io/github/valossa515/tapguard/core/detection/signal/InstallSourceCollectorTrustedStoreTest.kt,modify,AC-006 e AC-016; nova assinatura e banco e nao banco nas onze lojas
